On 7/30/2026 7:37 AM, Borislav Petkov wrote:
> On Mon, Jul 27, 2026 at 07:04:57PM +0000, Ashish Kalra wrote:
>> @@ -705,10 +760,12 @@ bool snp_probe_rmptable_info(void)
