+/*
+ * A slice represents a portion of memory space participating in an
+ * interleave relationship within the memory hierarchy.
+ *
+ * It can represent in different levels such as:
+ *
+ *   - a pair of memory controllers
+ *   - a memory controller
+ *   - a memory channel
